#: scenario8:scenario8_ECF573D7_FB0B_4034_A893_9BA6A3DEC58B
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 3ea76c4ce38e96134f9c661058441592092a841e9467e6ba04ea2935ae001809
