#: scenario8:scenario8_C81F0E3B_6618_46FA_9D91_E6701D26E623
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 17d91764c7e46b3eaa69f168dc940cd608ca2310359f8a5955579bdefc0acb41
